#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:162
msgid ""
"Default Storage location is ``/var/opt/morpheus/morpheus-ui/vms``. "
"Additional Storage Providers can be configured in `Infrastructure > "
"Storage`. Ensure local folders are owned by morpheus-app.morpheus-app if "
"used."
msgstr "Default Storage location is ``/var/opt/morpheus/morpheus-ui/vms``. Additional Storage Providers puede ser configured in `Infrastructure > Storage`. Ensure local folders are owned by morpheus-app.morpheus-app if used."

#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:164
msgid ""
"Provisioning will fail if `Cloud init Enabled` is checked and Cloud-Init "
"is not installed on the Image."
msgstr "Provisioning será/n fail si `Nube init Enabled` es checked y Nube-Init es ningún installed en el/la Image."

#: ../../library/virtual_images/virtual_images.rst:166
msgid ""
"Existing Image credentials are required for Linux Images that are not "
"Cloud-Init enabled and for Windows Images when Guest Customizations are "
"not used. Cloud-Init and Windows user settings need to be configured in "
"|AdmSetPro| when using Cloud-Init or Guest Customizations and new "
"credentials are not set on the Virtual Image."
msgstr "Existing Image credentials son requerido/requerida para Linux Images ese/esa son ningún Nube-Init habilitado/habilitada y para Windows Images cuando Guest Customizations son ningún used. Nube-Init y Windows user settings need a be configurado/configurada en |AdmSetPro| cuando using Nube-Init o Guest Customizations y nuevo/nueva credentials son ningún establecido/establecida en el/la Imagen virtual."

